### CH5-3 · VS Code REST Client – click "Send Request" above each ###
@base = http://localhost:3000/api

### List products
GET {{base}}/products?q=pen

### One product (200) and a missing one (404)
GET {{base}}/products/1

###
GET {{base}}/products/9999

### Create a product (201)
POST {{base}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Notebook", "price": 45, "stock": 30, "categoryId": 1 }

### Validation error (400)
POST {{base}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Bad", "price": "free" }

### Replace with PUT (send all fields)
PUT {{base}}/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Blue Pen", "price": 18, "stock": 90, "categoryId": 1 }

### Update stock only with PATCH
PATCH {{base}}/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "stock": 5 }

### Delete (204), run twice → 404
DELETE {{base}}/products/2
